{'symbol': 'APD', 'date': '2022-03-08 13:44:00', 'title': 'AIR PRODUCTS TO BUILD GREEN LIQUID HYDROGEN PRODUCTION FACILITY IN ARIZONA', 'text': 'LEHIGH VALLEY, PA. , MARCH 8, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AIR PRODUCTS (NYSE:APD), A WORLD LEADER IN THE SUPPLY, DISTRIBUTION, AND DISPENSING OF HYDROGEN,\xa0TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT WILL BUILD, OWN AND OPERATE A 10 METRIC TON PER DAY FACILITY TO PRODUCE GREEN LIQUID HYDROGEN IN CASA GRANDE, ARIZONA.'}